        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The process includes the steps of needle-entangling a nonwoven fabric, preferably a spun-bonded polyester web, from one or both sides, heat-setting the needled web, calendering and cooling the web and then saturating with a liquid curable elastomeric binder. The saturated web preferably is treated to remove the excess binder, heated to dry the web and cure the binder, and wound up on rolls. The resultant fabric is dimensionally stable and has elastomeric properties similar to a woven fabric which provide improved tuft grip and repairability when used as a backing for tufted carpeting (Aseree, 2006)

This process includes the use of the needle loom machine, heat setting stenter machine, and hot calendering machine. It has function of needle punching, drying and curing. The activity starts when the raw materials enter the process. The chemicals (latex and silicone), energy consumption and infrastructure of the machine are included. There is no direct emission to air since the emission comes from electricity usage, while hazardous waste comes from waste lube oil. In the model, the energy sources of machines used solely from electricity, steam (for heat setting stenter), and thermal oil (for hot calendering). The cooling process using the conventional method so it doesn't required energy. The consumption of lubricating oil for needle loom using a stitch bonding machine as a proxy, heat setting stenter using a thermobonding oven as a proxy, and the hot calendering machine using the hot calendering machine itself. In the model, the latex and silicone (elastomeric binder) is part of the final product. Hence, there is no waste or emission resulted from the usage of elastomeric binders. The raw material of the primary backing is polypropylene with 115 GSM output.

Aseree, Lester M. 2006. PROCESS OF PREPARING CARPET BACKING USING NONWOVEN MATERAL, https://patents.google.com/patent/US20070298208A1/en, United States
Domotex. 2020. Primary Backing, https://www.domotex.de/product/primary-backing/204373/K616779</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
